{"version":1,"content":"\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/iphone-duo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 今日在香港開售，開售前有人樂觀預期先達回收價可高出官方售價約 HK$5,000。實際上，早上最高只賺約 HK$3,700，中午回落至約 HK$2,800，到下午 3 時再跌至約 HK$2,600。其後價格重新反彈，到傍晚 6 時半，賺幅最高的夜空色 2TB 回升至約 HK$3,500，逼近早上高位。每位顧客限購兩部，以此型號計最多可賺約 HK$7,000。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"單手握持的 iPhone Duo 外螢幕顯示主畫面。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1060\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-duo-scalp-02.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<h2>最新先達回收價</h2>\n<p>以下為 iPhonePriceHK 2026 年 10 月 23 日 18:33 的先達報價，並列出每部相對官方售價的賺幅。</p>\n<p>Apple 香港列出的 <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/iphone-duo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 官方售價分別為 256GB HK$17,499、512GB HK$19,299、1TB HK$22,799 及 2TB HK$27,999，提供夜空色及星光白色。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"多部不同角度的 iPhone Duo，展示外螢幕與內螢幕。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-duo-scalp-21.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<figure><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>容量</strong></td><td><strong>官方售價</strong></td><td><strong>夜空色回收價（賺幅）</strong></td><td><strong>星光白色回收價（賺幅）</strong></td></tr><tr><td>256GB</td><td>HK$17,499</td><td>HK$20,550（+HK$3,051）</td><td>HK$20,000（+HK$2,501）</td></tr><tr><td>512GB</td><td>HK$19,299</td><td>HK$22,000（+HK$2,701）</td><td>HK$21,600（+HK$2,301）</td></tr><tr><td>1TB</td><td>HK$22,799</td><td>HK$25,600（+HK$2,801）</td><td>HK$24,700（+HK$1,901）</td></tr><tr><td>2TB</td><td>HK$27,999</td><td>HK$31,500（+HK$3,501）</td><td>HK$30,600（+HK$2,601）</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"白色 iPhone Duo 摺合後展示鏡頭模組及內螢幕。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"844\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-duo-scalp-29.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:33.390512+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":625,"images":3,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:27:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:06.348845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:51.837119+00:00","content_hash":"e1f9891110287c58c38974d161421275fc91fe2fb5cbcf6d4ff85b19953421e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:33.390512+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}